(4784715, 691553, 24896, '<td valign="top">I like this its got GREED soooothing out if it. The line of the shoulders, the chin up, and her expression are perfect! And I am scoring it high. Just a couple things " I " think that could have really made this pic great. The glasses just don''t fit the style they look cheap, the reflection of you (and is that another person too) in the glasses doesnt help either, and I''m not a fan of the shadow on the face. But, this is a great idea. Good luck. Scott</td>', 'I like this its got GREED soooothing out if it. The line of the shoulders, the chin up, and her expression are perfect! And I am scoring it high. Just a couple things " I " think that could have really made this pic great. The glasses just don''t fit the style they look cheap, the reflection of you (and is that another person too) in the glasses doesnt help either, and I''m not a fan of the shadow on the face. But, this is a great idea. Good luck. Scott', '2008-06-25 02:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
