(4784739, 691497, 24896, '<td valign="top">WOW! hardest pic of the bunch for me to rate. It''s very cool, I like the broken glass with the splash and everything. I don''t read titles as a rule when voting and I''m not one to comment DNMC..but this is a great.. and I hate to say but I just couldn''t get how this fits the challenge without your title.. still a 7 for a great, creative, well executed, technically sound photo. Best of luck. Scott</td>', 'WOW! hardest pic of the bunch for me to rate. It''s very cool, I like the broken glass with the splash and everything. I don''t read titles as a rule when voting and I''m not one to comment DNMC..but this is a great.. and I hate to say but I just couldn''t get how this fits the challenge without your title.. still a 7 for a great, creative, well executed, technically sound photo. Best of luck. Scott', '2008-06-25 03:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
