(4784827, 690203, 82503, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge for multiple reasons. You have two sins in one picture, the setup is well thought out, composition and DOF are fitting and the green light on the left is a clever addition. This should ribbon!<br/> <br/>There''s only one small aspect I don''t like: The person on the left is looking through a door that''s wide open. I would assume that the couple would have closed it by now unless they are exhibitionists... So a window might have told the story more convincingly.</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge for multiple reasons. You have two sins in one picture, the setup is well thought out, composition and DOF are fitting and the green light on the left is a clever addition. This should ribbon! There''s only one small aspect I don''t like: The person on the left is looking through a door that''s wide open. I would assume that the couple would have closed it by now unless they are exhibitionists... So a window might have told the story more convincingly.', '2008-06-25 07:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
