(4784913, 690495, 56828, '<td valign="top">This may just be a tad bit too dark.  I like the concept, but you need just a little more light on the bottle and give a little more silhoutte on the woman.  Great concept.</td>', 'This may just be a tad bit too dark.  I like the concept, but you need just a little more light on the bottle and give a little more silhoutte on the woman.  Great concept.', '2008-06-25 08:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4784917, 690992, 56828, '<td valign="top">I feel like I missed something.  I don''t see the eyes. unless you are intending it to be the eye of a storm, which i can''t really see.  Also you should have cropped your photo.  Three quarters of the photo is background in photoshop (white).  Very distracting.</td>', 'I feel like I missed something.  I don''t see the eyes. unless you are intending it to be the eye of a storm, which i can''t really see.  Also you should have cropped your photo.  Three quarters of the photo is background in photoshop (white).  Very distracting.', '2008-06-25 09:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4784941, 691617, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like the idea around this photo.  Your focus is off though.  this photo would have been better if either the two girls in the back or hte lady up front were in focus.  Instead the water in the background is crisp and everything else is out of focus.</td>', 'I like the idea around this photo.  Your focus is off though.  this photo would have been better if either the two girls in the back or hte lady up front were in focus.  Instead the water in the background is crisp and everything else is out of focus.', '2008-06-25 09:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4784944, 690377, 45857, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the topic, good composition and techs.<br/>I might have tried to bring up the green in her eyes a bit more.<br/>I''m not sure about the nails they seem a bit of an overkill to me, perhaps the "Snow White" theme would be enough to carry the concept. 8</td>', 'Interesting take on the topic, good composition and techs.I might have tried to bring up the green in her eyes a bit more.I''m not sure about the nails they seem a bit of an overkill to me, perhaps the "Snow White" theme would be enough to carry the concept. 8', '2008-06-25 09:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4784949, 691291, 45857, '<td valign="top">Good idea, just not sure if the B&amp;W works that well, of course have no clue as to the colors involved. i do like his wicked little grin. 6</td>', 'Good idea, just not sure if the B&W works that well, of course have no clue as to the colors involved. i do like his wicked little grin. 6', '2008-06-25 09:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4784959, 690385, 45857, '<td valign="top">Good idea done in a somewhat average fashion.<br/>Your composition and lighting are good.<br/>Color seems a bit flat and plastic (of course they are plastic), but they lack the vividness of the ''pink asile'' Perhaps WB adjustment would help.<br/>I know how tough it is when you use one piece of cloth for background and also covering your table, but the wrinkles are a big problem here. Either try to get the backdrop further behind your subject or iron your sheet.<br/>Also a shallower DOF would help.  5</td>', 'Good idea done in a somewhat average fashion.Your composition and lighting are good.Color seems a bit flat and plastic (of course they are plastic), but they lack the vividness of the ''pink asile'' Perhaps WB adjustment would help.I know how tough it is when you use one piece of cloth for background and also covering your table, but the wrinkles are a big problem here. Either try to get the backdrop further behind your subject or iron your sheet.Also a shallower DOF would help.  5', '2008-06-25 09:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
