(4792007, 690790, 90387, '<td valign="top">Excellent image.  I can''t believe I didn''t see this when glancing through the thumbnails.  Love the droplets of water still showing on her arm and face. Love the shadows and light play on the right had side. I would love to see this as an advanced edit as well, as I''m sure there are a few things you would have liked to do.  I can''t wait to see who took this! :-)</td>', 'Excellent image.  I can''t believe I didn''t see this when glancing through the thumbnails.  Love the droplets of water still showing on her arm and face. Love the shadows and light play on the right had side. I would love to see this as an advanced edit as well, as I''m sure there are a few things you would have liked to do.  I can''t wait to see who took this! :-)', '2008-06-30 17:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792015, 690423, 90387, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Excellent shot! Nothing like it in this challenge, and can''t recall seeing anything like it before.  I don''t normally say what score I''m handing out, but this is a 10!</td>', 'WOW!  Excellent shot! Nothing like it in this challenge, and can''t recall seeing anything like it before.  I don''t normally say what score I''m handing out, but this is a 10!', '2008-06-30 17:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
