(4794858, 690676, 94931, '<td valign="top">Cute photo. Children are so innocent, even when they''re being naughty. That''s why I can''t see this as sinful.<br/>Looks like this might benefit from some fill flash as she''s a bit dark.<br/>Also, this doesn''t meet the definition of Gluttony. From Wiki: "GLUTTONY - Derived from the Latin gluttire, meaning to gulp down or swallow, gluttony is the over-indulgence and over-consumption of anything to the point of waste. In the Christian religions, it is considered a sin because of the excessive desire for food, or its withholding from the needy."</td>', 'Cute photo. Children are so innocent, even when they''re being naughty. That''s why I can''t see this as sinful.Looks like this might benefit from some fill flash as she''s a bit dark.Also, this doesn''t meet the definition of Gluttony. From Wiki: "GLUTTONY - Derived from the Latin gluttire, meaning to gulp down or swallow, gluttony is the over-indulgence and over-consumption of anything to the point of waste. In the Christian religions, it is considered a sin because of the excessive desire for food, or its withholding from the needy."', '2008-07-01 15:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
