(4794977, 691380, 83416, '<td valign="top">In my opinion - the mood of this shot perfectly meets the challenge description  as opposed to some other great entries which are to colorful for sins. The only thing I personally would have tried as an alternative (assuming it was at all possible)  is to go for a darker image altogether, so that the light the character is reaching for stands out more.</td>', 'In my opinion - the mood of this shot perfectly meets the challenge description  as opposed to some other great entries which are to colorful for sins. The only thing I personally would have tried as an alternative (assuming it was at all possible)  is to go for a darker image altogether, so that the light the character is reaching for stands out more.', '2008-07-01 15:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4794984, 690679, 94931, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get the sin here?</td>', 'I just don''t get the sin here?', '2008-07-01 15:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4794987, 691274, 94931, '<td valign="top">Great subject, I just think you could have composed a much better shot.</td>', 'Great subject, I just think you could have composed a much better shot.', '2008-07-01 15:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4794993, 691617, 94931, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better to have one of the subjects in focus.</td>', 'I think it would be better to have one of the subjects in focus.', '2008-07-01 15:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4794997, 691648, 83416, '<td valign="top">Believe it always makes sense to use the allowed 640 pixels.</td>', 'Believe it always makes sense to use the allowed 640 pixels.', '2008-07-01 15:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795008, 691597, 83416, '<td valign="top">I personally do not see a sin here Hope thats only me and in the end your submission will do ok.</td>', 'I personally do not see a sin here Hope thats only me and in the end your submission will do ok.', '2008-07-01 15:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795019, 691505, 83416, '<td valign="top">The idea is ok  execution could be better.</td>', 'The idea is ok  execution could be better.', '2008-07-01 15:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795034, 690992, 83416, '<td valign="top">I am guessing the white canvas is accidental  good luck! Good capture of the clouds.</td>', 'I am guessing the white canvas is accidental  good luck! Good capture of the clouds.', '2008-07-01 15:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795039, 690117, 83416, '<td valign="top">Are all of them sinners? :-D</td>', 'Are all of them sinners? :-D', '2008-07-01 16:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795045, 691521, 83416, '<td valign="top">Id say thats happy  not sinfully proud :-D</td>', 'Id say thats happy  not sinfully proud :-D', '2008-07-01 16:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795051, 691607, 83416, '<td valign="top">To my taste: too much blur (guessing there was also glass or fence wire between you and the jaguar) and detail lost in the fur. These type of shots are not easy to come out nice. Good luck!</td>', 'To my taste: too much blur (guessing there was also glass or fence wire between you and the jaguar) and detail lost in the fur. These type of shots are not easy to come out nice. Good luck!', '2008-07-01 16:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795070, 691274, 83416, '<td valign="top">Good subject for these sins  I personally would have post-processed more (within the rules) to communicate the idea to the viewer.</td>', 'Good subject for these sins  I personally would have post-processed more (within the rules) to communicate the idea to the viewer.', '2008-07-01 16:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795073, 691189, 83416, '<td valign="top">I like how the cat is looking at the camera  more fill-flash may have helped to make the image more appealing. Just my opinion.</td>', 'I like how the cat is looking at the camera  more fill-flash may have helped to make the image more appealing. Just my opinion.', '2008-07-01 16:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795078, 691282, 83416, '<td valign="top">I personally wouldnt say gambling is greed driven  but thats only my opinion. To my taste image lacks contrast. Good luck!</td>', 'I personally wouldnt say gambling is greed driven  but thats only my opinion. To my taste image lacks contrast. Good luck!', '2008-07-01 16:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795087, 691450, 83416, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity and color tone.</td>', 'I like the clarity and color tone.', '2008-07-01 16:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795100, 691272, 83416, '<td valign="top">I would suggest either a tighter crop/zoom in (so that the grass is not visible)  or go for the whole bird.</td>', 'I would suggest either a tighter crop/zoom in (so that the grass is not visible)  or go for the whole bird.', '2008-07-01 16:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795105, 691541, 83416, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the beautiful bird. Not that sure about the sin part</td>', 'Nice capture of the beautiful bird. Not that sure about the sin part', '2008-07-01 16:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795112, 690999, 83416, '<td valign="top">Well done! And is a sin to have that entrapped :-D</td>', 'Well done! And is a sin to have that entrapped :-D', '2008-07-01 16:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795124, 691553, 83416, '<td valign="top">I like how the expression on her face reflects her attitude towards the poorer people which may be surrounding her. This appears to be too noisy, though.</td>', 'I like how the expression on her face reflects her attitude towards the poorer people which may be surrounding her. This appears to be too noisy, though.', '2008-07-01 16:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795146, 690679, 83416, '<td valign="top">I must be missing something here (not clear what the child is actually doing) and do not see a sin. An appealing capture either way!</td>', 'I must be missing something here (not clear what the child is actually doing) and do not see a sin. An appealing capture either way!', '2008-07-01 16:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795152, 690184, 83416, '<td valign="top">Your choice of processing works well here.</td>', 'Your choice of processing works well here.', '2008-07-01 16:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795179, 691570, 83416, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait  but personally prefer more pride in her expression.</td>', 'Nice portrait  but personally prefer more pride in her expression.', '2008-07-01 16:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795184, 690515, 83416, '<td valign="top">I think the lights a bit harsh</td>', 'I think the lights a bit harsh', '2008-07-01 16:52:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4795200, 689862, 83416, '<td valign="top">While the idea is interesting  in my opinion the shot could have been thought through better. Good luck!</td>', 'While the idea is interesting  in my opinion the shot could have been thought through better. Good luck!', '2008-07-01 16:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795204, 691596, 83416, '<td valign="top">The dog doesnt appear as a sinner to me  nice capture though.</td>', 'The dog doesnt appear as a sinner to me  nice capture though.', '2008-07-01 16:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795207, 691504, 83416, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot.</td>', 'Nice candid shot.', '2008-07-01 17:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795221, 691617, 83416, '<td valign="top">The focus is on the sea water. If that was your intention here  believe the group to the right spoils the shot. In case the woman is envious of the younger people  see no reason why focus is on the water. Good luck!</td>', 'The focus is on the sea water. If that was your intention here  believe the group to the right spoils the shot. In case the woman is envious of the younger people  see no reason why focus is on the water. Good luck!', '2008-07-01 17:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795230, 690203, 83416, '<td valign="top">I like the idea  but the execution is not very appealing. But thats just my opinion.</td>', 'I like the idea  but the execution is not very appealing. But thats just my opinion.', '2008-07-01 17:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795246, 691577, 83416, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how this picture communicates a sin Hope other voters figured it out and voted ok.</td>', 'I am not sure how this picture communicates a sin Hope other voters figured it out and voted ok.', '2008-07-01 17:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795258, 691638, 83416, '<td valign="top">A great idea for this challenge  I would however prefer to see the womans face or at least a hint on what the expression on her face may be Also  the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'A great idea for this challenge  I would however prefer to see the womans face or at least a hint on what the expression on her face may be Also  the background is a bit distracting.', '2008-07-01 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795276, 691649, 83416, '<td valign="top">I like this shot  but not that sure it communicates sin well. Rather a very relaxed mood.</td>', 'I like this shot  but not that sure it communicates sin well. Rather a very relaxed mood.', '2008-07-01 17:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795286, 691529, 83416, '<td valign="top">If at all possible  would suggest finding a way to get rid of the shadow on his face - from the cap.</td>', 'If at all possible  would suggest finding a way to get rid of the shadow on his face - from the cap.', '2008-07-01 17:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795302, 691507, 83416, '<td valign="top">Great effort to show sin by capturing just the look</td>', 'Great effort to show sin by capturing just the look', '2008-07-01 17:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795307, 691617, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot.  I''m curious why you focused on the water though and rather the girls.</td>', 'This is a really good shot.  I''m curious why you focused on the water though and rather the girls.', '2008-07-01 17:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795310, 690790, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...but I''m not getting the challenge from it.</td>', 'Nice shot...but I''m not getting the challenge from it.', '2008-07-01 17:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795323, 690495, 83416, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge nicely  I like how you decided to obscure the characters with darkness and let the viewer guess what may be happening there</td>', 'Meets challenge nicely  I like how you decided to obscure the characters with darkness and let the viewer guess what may be happening there', '2008-07-01 17:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795331, 691462, 83416, '<td valign="top">The colors and motion blur work well for the challenge  I would still like to see the expression on his face and less noise.</td>', 'The colors and motion blur work well for the challenge  I would still like to see the expression on his face and less noise.', '2008-07-01 17:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795333, 691151, 83416, '<td valign="top">Id prefer this without the leaves in the foreground.</td>', 'Id prefer this without the leaves in the foreground.', '2008-07-01 17:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795341, 691183, 83416, '<td valign="top">Good capture of natures extremes. Those two lights in the bottom centre are a bit distracting  not sure what they are.</td>', 'Good capture of natures extremes. Those two lights in the bottom centre are a bit distracting  not sure what they are.', '2008-07-01 17:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795347, 691232, 83416, '<td valign="top">Like the expression on his face and overall mood  not that fond of the title.</td>', 'Like the expression on his face and overall mood  not that fond of the title.', '2008-07-01 17:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795366, 691201, 83416, '<td valign="top">My personal opinion: a piece of cake does not communicate sin so well</td>', 'My personal opinion: a piece of cake does not communicate sin so well', '2008-07-01 17:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795379, 690334, 83416, '<td valign="top">Well executed modern interpretation of a classic sin</td>', 'Well executed modern interpretation of a classic sin', '2008-07-01 17:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795409, 690515, 70896, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting, but I dont know why, the pose just doesnt work for me. I wish she had been putting the marshmellows in her mouth, maybe looking at the camera with a guilty look? 7</td>', 'I really like the lighting, but I dont know why, the pose just doesnt work for me. I wish she had been putting the marshmellows in her mouth, maybe looking at the camera with a guilty look? 7', '2008-07-01 17:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795420, 691214, 70896, '<td valign="top">It looks a little bit OOF. I would like to see the left sided cropped, and all of her hand (on the right). Cute idea though.</td>', 'It looks a little bit OOF. I would like to see the left sided cropped, and all of her hand (on the right). Cute idea though.', '2008-07-01 17:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795423, 689862, 70896, '<td valign="top">I have to be honest with you... I love the tittle... Now, I''m guessing youre trying to portray greed? Its a cool, different idea for sure. Focus is good, although i feel like you could have cropped it more.  Its a 7 from me. :)</td>', 'I have to be honest with you... I love the tittle... Now, I''m guessing youre trying to portray greed? Its a cool, different idea for sure. Focus is good, although i feel like you could have cropped it more.  Its a 7 from me. :)', '2008-07-01 17:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795430, 691642, 70896, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a beautiful pic, the lighting is great and the pose. But her expression just doesnt say lust to me. She looks very delicate, and almost innocent.</td>', 'I think it''s a beautiful pic, the lighting is great and the pose. But her expression just doesnt say lust to me. She looks very delicate, and almost innocent.', '2008-07-01 18:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795431, 691151, 70896, '<td valign="top">He looks like he''s just taking a break!</td>', 'He looks like he''s just taking a break!', '2008-07-01 18:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795484, 691613, 83416, '<td valign="top">I like the use of bright colors and your choice to show only part of the scene to communicate the laziness.</td>', 'I like the use of bright colors and your choice to show only part of the scene to communicate the laziness.', '2008-07-01 18:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795488, 691555, 83416, '<td valign="top">I personally would prefer a tighter crop/zoom in for such an image.</td>', 'I personally would prefer a tighter crop/zoom in for such an image.', '2008-07-01 18:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795745, 691253, 90387, '<td valign="top">Cool Macro shot with awesome colors.  Just not sure which  sin is being represented based on the picture.  wrath?</td>', 'Cool Macro shot with awesome colors.  Just not sure which  sin is being represented based on the picture.  wrath?', '2008-07-01 19:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795747, 690694, 90387, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  I''ve been looking at it for awhile and am still seeing new details hidden in there.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Very cool shot!  I''ve been looking at it for awhile and am still seeing new details hidden in there.  Very nice work.', '2008-07-01 19:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795750, 691462, 90387, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Reminds of a henry rollins cover minus the tats.  Nice work!</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Reminds of a henry rollins cover minus the tats.  Nice work!', '2008-07-01 19:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795751, 690184, 90387, '<td valign="top">I really like the texture and sharpness here.  It looks so real it''s un-real.  Nice job.</td>', 'I really like the texture and sharpness here.  It looks so real it''s un-real.  Nice job.', '2008-07-01 19:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795753, 691010, 90387, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF here.  good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Nice use of DOF here.  good luck in the challenge!', '2008-07-01 19:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795756, 691032, 90387, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m not the first to say this seems a bit of a shoehorn for the challenge. One thing that I really like though, is the sparling bokeh in the bacground.  Definitely worht of comment.  Good Luck!</td>', 'I''m sure I''m not the first to say this seems a bit of a shoehorn for the challenge. One thing that I really like though, is the sparling bokeh in the bacground.  Definitely worht of comment.  Good Luck!', '2008-07-01 19:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795762, 691645, 90387, '<td valign="top">Holy wow!  Can''t believe I didn''t see this in the thumbnails. I love the details you were able to capture in the fire and burning wood to the right.  Great colors also.  hope this does well for you!</td>', 'Holy wow!  Can''t believe I didn''t see this in the thumbnails. I love the details you were able to capture in the fire and burning wood to the right.  Great colors also.  hope this does well for you!', '2008-07-01 19:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795764, 690515, 90387, '<td valign="top">This is making me slightly sick to my stomach!  I like marshmallows, but yuck! :-)  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is making me slightly sick to my stomach!  I like marshmallows, but yuck! :-)  Good luck in the challenge!', '2008-07-01 19:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795767, 691597, 90387, '<td valign="top">You actually have some pretty healthy stuff in there! Wait, I found something.  you tried to hide that hot fudge there on the top shelf!</td>', 'You actually have some pretty healthy stuff in there! Wait, I found something.  you tried to hide that hot fudge there on the top shelf!', '2008-07-01 19:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4795769, 691187, 90387, '<td valign="top">The softness adds a kind of dreamy feel that goes with your title. I''m sure that was intentional! :-)</td>', 'The softness adds a kind of dreamy feel that goes with your title. I''m sure that was intentional! :-)', '2008-07-01 19:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
