(4796133, 690992, 22970, '<td valign="top">I think this is the first I have seen where someone used the full 640x480 and their picture was only a 1/4 that size. Can''t really see any details, sorry.</td>', 'I think this is the first I have seen where someone used the full 640x480 and their picture was only a 1/4 that size. Can''t really see any details, sorry.', '2008-07-01 22:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
