(4796191, 691627, 22970, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape and captured quit well. I don''t see how it fits well with the challenge, sorry.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape and captured quit well. I don''t see how it fits well with the challenge, sorry.', '2008-07-01 22:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
