(4797038, 690334, 50231, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jonfrommk:</b></div><hr/><i> Ah yes, how predictable.  The photographic equivalent of a three year old girl pulling her dress over her head at a party or a three year old boy learning the word poopie and repeating it ad nauseum...attention seeking and not funny. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>To be honest with you Jon it seems you are the 3 year old girl throwing a tantrum. So here it is the comment you were waiting for to validate your sour grapes. Tim is my boy and I am in a sense defending him at the same time flaming you. If only you would have commented on the concept and photography and not the man, it just smacks of jealousy and I can''t believe Tim checked your comment as helpful. I would have checked it "childish". :-/<br/> <br/>@ Tim I will deleted this comment if you want. Just PM me and it will be done. You have a thicker skin than I. It is a real bummer about the haters and I have never in my almost 3 years here seen a comment like that BS.</td>', 'Originally posted by jonfrommk: Ah yes, how predictable.  The photographic equivalent of a three year old girl pulling her dress over her head at a party or a three year old boy learning the word poopie and repeating it ad nauseum...attention seeking and not funny.   To be honest with you Jon it seems you are the 3 year old girl throwing a tantrum. So here it is the comment you were waiting for to validate your sour grapes. Tim is my boy and I am in a sense defending him at the same time flaming you. If only you would have commented on the concept and photography and not the man, it just smacks of jealousy and I can''t believe Tim checked your comment as helpful. I would have checked it "childish". :-/ @ Tim I will deleted this comment if you want. Just PM me and it will be done. You have a thicker skin than I. It is a real bummer about the haters and I have never in my almost 3 years here seen a comment like that BS.', '2008-07-02 02:53:22.000000', NULL, 0),
